Hi, Monicules here!
Welcome to the Lift Club! It's always been a dream of mine to make lifting a passion for everyone. Now that you're a club member, you can help me and my team get ripped!

Every day is full of lifting and incredible stories with my four ripped members:
Slavyori, the young Russian stereotype that values vodka the most;
Buffsuki, the cutest one of the group and her anime tsundere attitude;
Yuronk, the shy buffed girl that's completely passionate about lifting;
...And, of course, Monicules, the leader of the club! That's me, the best!

I'm super excited for you to join our amazing club and to start helping us get ripped. But I can tell already you're a tough one, so... Will you lift the way into our hearts?

